 that the scavenger Jadis  had a connection to the copter the  timing of the helicopters appearance  could be a possible introduction of the  Commonwealth storyline from the comics  however it seems that alpha and the  whispers are also on their way so season  9 of The Walking Dead might be blending  multiple comic storylines and timelines  together the addition of alpha might  finally answer a long lingering question  about the prevalence of the letter A  that's been seen scattered throughout  the previous seasons gang has promised  that the significance of the letter will  come into view in season 9 telling fans  that it might have something to do with  Jadis Jadis might have made some  alliances before but does she have  another master controlling that  helicopter after all we'll see when the  Walking Dead Season 9 arrives on October  7  [Music]
 

